283
00:25:59,760 --> 00:26:02,800
You found a point where
the sup was achieved.

284
00:26:02,800 --> 00:26:03,300
OK.

285
00:26:03,300 --> 00:26:06,420
So that proves the
extreme value theorem.

286
00:26:06,420 --> 00:26:09,360
By one of the two parts of
the extreme value theorem,

287
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:11,340
