00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:06,440
E is nonempty.

331
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:09,360
E here is not the empty set.

332
00:30:09,360 --> 00:30:11,040
Why?

333
00:30:11,040 --> 00:30:14,500
Because actually, a here--

334
00:30:14,500 --> 00:30:23,180
this is since a here is in
