349
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:26,000
And I can look at the sup.

350
00:31:31,250 --> 00:31:32,610
So the claim here is--

351
00:31:41,990 --> 00:31:45,950
or maybe let me
just first say set

352
00:31:45,950 --> 00:31:51,310
x not equal to that
sup of E. And then

353
00:31:51,310 --> 00:31:58,550
the claim is that f
of x0 is actually 0.

354
00:32:08,970 --> 00:32:18,870
And so now you see
that if you take--

355
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,050
right.

356
00:32:23,050 --> 00:32:26,240
So now look at the sup.

357
00:32:29,770 --> 00:32:49,570
So for each n, say, integer, if
