394
00:36:47,510 --> 00:36:52,590
And here, I have x0.

395
00:36:52,590 --> 00:36:56,410
But now because the
function is continuous,

396
00:36:56,410 --> 00:36:58,890
I know that there
exists an interval.

397
00:36:58,890 --> 00:37:01,120
So there exists some delta.

398
00:37:01,120 --> 00:37:08,920
There exists delta
bigger than 0 so

399
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:11,380
that if I'm in this
little interval--

400
00:37:11,380 --> 00:37:17,800
this is the interval from x0
minus delta, x0 plus delta.

401
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:20,360
If I'm looking at
this little interval,

402
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:26,720
then anything here is
taken into this thing here.

403
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:32,840
So in other words, I
have that if x minus x0

404
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:41,240
is less than delta, then
f of dx minus f of x0

405
00:37:41,240 --> 00:37:44,640
is less than epsilon.

406
00:37:44,640 --> 00:37:47,960
But everything that is
in this interval here

407
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:49,660
is still strictly negative.

408
00:37:49,660 --> 00:37:51,340
So this means that in fact--

409
00:37:56,220 --> 00:38:00,100
in particular, this
implies such that f of x

410
00:38:00,100 --> 00:38:01,400
is actually negative.

411
00:38:07,240 --> 00:38:11,490
So now I want to get a
contradiction because I know--

412
00:38:14,060 --> 00:38:15,880
so now I have this picture here.

413
00:38:23,540 --> 00:38:26,220
I have my x0 here.

414
00:38:26,220 --> 00:38:37,160
The x0 was supposed to
be the sup of the set A.

415
00:38:37,160 --> 00:38:42,900
So I know that, actually, on a
little interval around this x0,

416
00:38:42,900 --> 00:38:45,660
everything is--

417
00:38:45,660 --> 00:38:49,900
if I take anything in a little
interval around this x0,

418
00:38:49,900 --> 00:38:54,180
then the values of f
are actually negative.

419
00:38:56,860 --> 00:39:04,070
But you see that this x0
was limits or points where

420
00:39:04,070 --> 00:39:08,550
everything to the
left was not positive.

421
00:39:08,550 --> 00:39:13,310
So it means that everything
to the left was not positive.

422
00:39:13,310 --> 00:39:20,150
But then even a little bit
further was still not positive.

423
00:39:20,150 --> 00:39:22,390
But then it wasn't like the sup.

424
00:39:22,390 --> 00:39:26,350
Because anything
here would be larger,

425
00:39:26,350 --> 00:39:28,310
and it still would
have the property

426
00:39:28,310 --> 00:39:34,130
that everything to the left
