775
01:05:02,890 --> 01:05:06,370
this also extends
to metric spaces.

776
01:05:06,370 --> 01:05:24,138
So a Cauchy sequence in a
metric space is the following.

777
01:05:35,910 --> 01:05:38,820
So a Cauchy sequence--
let's call it xn.

778
01:05:41,670 --> 01:05:49,350
It's the following, that for
