786
01:06:31,600 --> 01:06:33,900
So we have a theorem.

787
01:06:33,900 --> 01:06:37,412
Let's say that if you have a--

788
01:06:37,412 --> 01:06:39,060
so theorem is the following.

789
01:06:44,280 --> 01:06:48,370
So, again, X comma
d is a metric space.

790
01:06:57,880 --> 01:07:15,620
And if xn is a
convergent sequence in X,

791
01:07:15,620 --> 01:07:25,530
then xn also a Cauchy sequence.

792
01:07:32,970 --> 01:07:35,580
Now, how do we prove this?

793
01:07:35,580 --> 01:07:39,500
So prove it really is kind
of the same as we did before.

794
01:07:39,500 --> 01:07:43,760
So prove-- so we have
