01:09:17,050 --> 01:09:18,590
it is a Cauchy sequence.

814
01:09:18,590 --> 01:09:22,569
Remember that Cauchy convergence
theorem was saying that

815
01:09:22,569 --> 01:09:28,569
in R, if you have
